  "description": "The meme expresses mockery through exaggerated visual contrast and brand-based stereotypes, implying that Chevrolet owners are more practical and gritty while Ford owners are more showy and dramatic. This is conveyed through the juxtaposition of the muddy Chevy truck and the dramatically kicking-up-mud Ford truck, along with the text overlays that frame these as stereotypical behaviors.",
